WEBVTT

00:07.617 --> 00:12.837
<i>The war ended, and peace was established 
between the kingdom and principality.</i>

00:14.827 --> 00:18.247
<i>Other nations had taken advantage 
of the war to invade,</i>

00:18.247 --> 00:21.267
<i>which demanded the kingdom's attention.</i>

00:23.707 --> 00:26.207
<i>But the principality itself was no more.</i>

00:26.727 --> 00:30.397
<i>House Fanoss rejoined 
the kingdom as a duchy.</i>

00:34.937 --> 00:40.067
<i>On top of exorbitant reparations,</i>

00:40.067 --> 00:44.217
<i>the kingdom was pushing for an 
unfair and humiliating treaty.</i>

00:44.217 --> 00:45.447
Lady Mylene.

00:47.267 --> 00:50.877
<i>Meanwhile, all the attention 
I was receiving from ladies</i>

00:50.877 --> 00:53.507
<i>put me in high spirits, but...</i>

00:58.887 --> 01:00.207
Viscount Bartfort.

01:01.367 --> 01:04.217
I have a personal request.

01:05.877 --> 01:08.347
Please don't, Lady Mylene!

01:08.347 --> 01:09.967
What's gotten into you?

01:11.657 --> 01:15.747
Please save Julius and his friends.

01:16.297 --> 01:17.257
What?

01:18.907 --> 01:21.477
You guys really are stupid.

01:19.027 --> 01:22.987
This World Is Really Tough for Mobs

01:21.907 --> 01:23.177
Bartfort.

01:24.537 --> 01:29.447
I don't want to be executed! Save me!

01:30.237 --> 01:31.637
What did you expect?

01:31.637 --> 01:35.197
That idiot attacked House Fanoss.

01:35.897 --> 01:38.127
I just caused a little commotion.

01:38.927 --> 01:44.167
I'm not marrying Hertrude to impose 
an unfair treaty on the principality.

01:44.167 --> 01:46.887
I'm nobody's tool.

01:46.887 --> 01:49.947
As a result, the palace 
completely lost face

01:49.947 --> 01:53.847
and had to compromise on the treaty.

01:55.367 --> 02:00.357
I never thought that idiot 
prince would be my savior.

02:04.107 --> 02:07.457
And you four went crazy at the temple.

02:07.817 --> 02:10.527
We were only stopping Marie's execution!

02:10.527 --> 02:13.337
After all, she's our Saint.

02:13.907 --> 02:16.117
We have no regrets.

02:16.117 --> 02:18.617
This is our code of chivalry!

02:19.317 --> 02:23.507
In any case, you made enemies 
of the palace and temple.

02:23.507 --> 02:24.497
Accept your deaths.

02:25.007 --> 02:29.307
No! Help me!

02:32.377 --> 02:34.057
Are you insane?

02:34.057 --> 02:38.327
You want me to spare them in exchange 
for what you earned in the war?

02:38.327 --> 02:43.077
Yes. If that's not enough, 
then I'll pay out of my own coffers.

02:43.077 --> 02:44.277
Please spare them.

02:45.847 --> 02:47.277
What should I do?

02:47.757 --> 02:51.277
<i>Look at this bastard putting on airs.</i>

02:51.937 --> 02:54.907
Milord, why go this far for them?

02:55.307 --> 02:58.107
Because I'm stuck with them, I guess.

02:59.207 --> 03:04.327
Besides, I'd originally intended to 
live a relaxed life as a baronet.

03:05.087 --> 03:07.377
I'll take this opportunity to start over.

03:09.527 --> 03:14.127
I see. They've gained a good friend.

03:15.027 --> 03:19.557
Your Highness, may I take it from here?

03:22.527 --> 03:23.937
Very well.

03:24.497 --> 03:29.277
<i>Great, but now I'm basically retired.</i>

03:29.277 --> 03:31.697
<i>It's the start of my new NPC life.</i>

03:32.427 --> 03:36.017
Also, about Angelica...

03:37.677 --> 03:40.087
Don't do it, Bartfort!

03:40.087 --> 03:42.107
Have you gone mad?!

03:42.107 --> 03:46.087
Shut up! Marie, your blood 
will stain Murasamekai!

03:46.437 --> 03:49.267
Wh-Why do you have that rare item?

03:49.267 --> 03:51.087
I thought you were saving me from death!

03:51.087 --> 03:55.157
I heard you made Angie and Livia grovel!

03:58.357 --> 04:01.097
That was, uh...

04:01.907 --> 04:05.787
Angie was shamed for tarnishing 
her family's name,

04:05.787 --> 04:08.397
and both she and Livia were hurt.

04:08.697 --> 04:11.527
So you have to die! I'll kill you!

04:12.897 --> 04:16.197
Stop! I won't let you 
lay a finger on Marie!

04:16.447 --> 04:18.357
Shut up! Kill her, Luxion!

04:18.357 --> 04:19.947
Are you sure?

04:20.357 --> 04:22.257
Kill her!

04:22.817 --> 04:24.707
In that case, pardon me.

04:31.617 --> 04:33.087
Me, too?

04:33.387 --> 04:35.607
Have you calmed down some?

04:37.297 --> 04:42.307
We have to live on a floating 
island in your territory?

04:42.307 --> 04:46.677
Yeah. You're to live a 
self-sufficient life there.

04:46.677 --> 04:48.357
You're being exiled.

04:48.997 --> 04:51.997
What? Absolutely not.

04:51.997 --> 04:54.107
Don't complain after I saved your neck!

04:54.107 --> 04:56.347
Or are you that desperate 
to lose your head?

04:56.347 --> 05:01.547
B-But I'm a city girl, you know?

05:02.537 --> 05:05.517
I bet you're planning to build 
another harem in the capital!

05:05.517 --> 05:07.727
Don't forget you were a hag with 
a kid in your previous life!

05:07.727 --> 05:12.247
Oh, shut up! You've got the villainess 
and protagonist serving you!

05:12.897 --> 05:16.637
Our relationship is pure, thank you!

05:16.637 --> 05:17.677
We're not like you!

05:17.677 --> 05:19.347
You're just a wimp!

05:19.347 --> 05:22.057
It's your fault I died!

05:22.417 --> 05:24.497
Luxion, say something!

05:24.497 --> 05:25.407
Yes, Master.

05:25.407 --> 05:30.057
I feel very sorry for your previous 
parents who had you two as children.

05:34.617 --> 05:39.757
Also, Marie is right. Perhaps it's 
time you made a decision, Master.

05:40.737 --> 05:42.427
What are you talking about?

05:42.787 --> 05:45.447
The two of them have just arrived.

05:45.447 --> 05:46.497
Huh?

05:50.367 --> 05:51.407
Mr. Leon.

05:50.367 --> 05:51.407
Leon.

05:54.097 --> 05:55.687
We need to talk.

05:56.427 --> 05:58.167
Do you have a minute?

06:01.417 --> 06:04.387
Wh-What'd you want to talk about?

06:05.197 --> 06:08.267
Leon, I love you.

06:10.617 --> 06:16.417
At some point, I started thinking 
about you more than His Highness.

06:17.177 --> 06:19.527
I enjoyed spending time with you.

06:20.687 --> 06:23.427
I felt comfortable being around you.

06:23.777 --> 06:26.977
I love you.

06:30.287 --> 06:34.037
<i>Wh-Why is she smiling?
What should I do?</i>

06:35.247 --> 06:37.037
Luxion, help...

06:39.907 --> 06:40.937
Who are you?

06:40.937 --> 06:43.667
Hi. It's me, Cleare.

06:43.667 --> 06:46.487
Oh, you're the <i>Vice</i>'s AI.

06:46.487 --> 06:47.807
Hello again.

06:48.787 --> 06:50.267
That voice...

06:50.267 --> 06:53.637
You're the AI from the elven ruins!

06:54.877 --> 06:56.817
I was transferred to this device.

06:57.347 --> 07:01.627
I see. Wait, where's Luxion?

07:01.627 --> 07:06.577
I asked that oaf to take a back seat.
They were happy to oblige.

07:06.807 --> 07:09.757
That bastard abandoned me!

07:09.757 --> 07:10.577
Mr. Leon.

07:10.577 --> 07:11.577
Y-Yes?

07:12.577 --> 07:15.547
I still love you.

07:16.157 --> 07:19.087
I believe nobody's feelings 
are stronger than mine.

07:19.737 --> 07:21.217
I-I see.

07:21.217 --> 07:22.837
<i>What the hell am I saying?</i>

07:23.247 --> 07:26.827
So please give us your answer.

07:26.827 --> 07:28.257
Me or Livia?

07:28.607 --> 07:31.477
No, you don't have to choose either of us.

07:32.047 --> 07:34.107
Just tell us how you feel.

07:36.007 --> 07:38.347
How I feel?

07:45.427 --> 07:46.507
I...

07:51.367 --> 07:55.747
I love both of you... you... you...

07:58.737 --> 08:03.377
<i>My dad was promoted to upper sixth 
rank for saving so many evacuees.</i>

08:04.017 --> 08:07.697
<i>He's currently helping me repair 
Arroganz and the </i>Partner<i>.</i>

08:08.917 --> 08:10.887
<i>After being forsaken by my dad,</i>

08:11.197 --> 08:13.887
<i>Zola's mansion in the capital 
burned down during the war,</i>

08:14.327 --> 08:19.087
<i>and her family was stripped of its 
title for refusing to join the war.</i>

08:20.517 --> 08:25.017
<i>In the capital, the attitude of female 
superiority was beginning to change.</i>

08:26.097 --> 08:27.277
<i>Meanwhile, I...</i>

08:30.257 --> 08:36.167
Viscount Leon Fou Bartfort, 
you performed splendidly in the war.

08:36.527 --> 08:40.047
<i>I'm so sleepy. Please let this end.</i>

08:41.357 --> 08:45.297
You are relieved of your 
duties as supreme commander.

08:45.707 --> 08:50.947
Also, I'm promoting you to 
count, lower third rank.

08:54.387 --> 08:56.437
<i>What?!</i>

08:56.757 --> 09:02.657
Your numerous achievements in 
battle call for a suitable title.

09:04.357 --> 09:06.427
A count as his age?

09:06.427 --> 09:08.777
That's the highest title for non-royals.

09:08.777 --> 09:10.907
He's more of an upstart than ever.

09:13.557 --> 09:16.517
<i>They look shocked, too.</i>

09:16.517 --> 09:21.527
<i>This asshole made this decision 
on his own to spite me!</i>

09:22.617 --> 09:25.917
<i>This is what you get for 
stealing the king's thunder.</i>

09:26.637 --> 09:28.547
If that is your wish, Your Majesty.

09:28.797 --> 09:30.797
<i>He's stealing my chance to shine.</i>

09:31.477 --> 09:34.907
I look forward to your 
future exploits, Count.

09:37.627 --> 09:44.307
<i>S-Screw this jerk! 
I'll get back at him someday!</i>

09:45.727 --> 09:47.277
You were promoted again?

09:48.007 --> 09:52.097
Well, aren't you lucky? 
Meanwhile, I've been exiled.

09:52.097 --> 09:54.987
Shut up. You don't know how I feel.

09:55.387 --> 09:57.507
Anyway, what'd you want to talk about?

09:57.507 --> 10:02.727
I actually have some important 
information about that otome game.

10:02.727 --> 10:03.667
What?

10:04.207 --> 10:08.327
You probably don't know since you 
died after beating the first game,

10:08.327 --> 10:11.087
but that otome game became a series.

10:11.517 --> 10:13.557
What? That shitty game?

10:14.347 --> 10:17.177
That's right. It wasn't popular at all,

10:17.177 --> 10:19.887
but the devs were weirdly 
passionate about it.

10:19.887 --> 10:22.057
I-I don't believe it.

10:22.477 --> 10:26.187
Additionally, only the land guardian 
was the final boss of the first game.

10:26.477 --> 10:30.067
The sky and sea guardians 
appear in the third game.

10:30.737 --> 10:35.307
Which means the first and third 
games were blended together.

10:35.307 --> 10:37.717
No wonder I didn't recognize them.

10:39.357 --> 10:41.077
Wait. Does that mean...

10:41.387 --> 10:44.677
Bingo. There's still the 
boss of the second game.

10:44.677 --> 10:46.627
This world isn't safe from danger yet.

10:46.627 --> 10:49.257
No way!

10:49.727 --> 10:51.677
Do you get it now?

10:51.677 --> 10:55.187
I know things about the 
game that you don't.

10:55.187 --> 10:57.517
So let's make a deal.

10:57.847 --> 11:00.137
What do you want?

11:00.797 --> 11:03.557
Well, for starters...

11:06.427 --> 11:08.277
Please give me an allowance!

11:09.107 --> 11:09.777
What?

11:10.217 --> 11:15.157
Carla and Kyle are fine, but those idiots 
could never survive in the boonies!

11:16.617 --> 11:21.467
They're no different from the useless 
hobosexuals of my previous life!

11:21.467 --> 11:23.587
Sparkle.

11:23.587 --> 11:27.047
You really are a magnet for shitty guys.

11:27.727 --> 11:30.047
Fine. You can have an allowance.

11:30.547 --> 11:33.927
Thank you, Brother!

11:34.607 --> 11:38.367
Whatever. Just tell me 
about the second game.

11:38.367 --> 11:39.427
Okay.

11:39.867 --> 11:44.437
The second game is set in the Alzer 
Republic instead of the kingdom.

11:45.087 --> 11:46.817
The Alzer Republic?

11:47.947 --> 11:49.937
Oh, that study abroad destination.

11:50.627 --> 11:53.937
<i>Apparently, the world is destroyed 
unless the protagonist gets together</i>

11:53.937 --> 11:55.947
<i>with a romantic interest 
in the second game.</i>

12:00.457 --> 12:03.057
Seriously, give me a break.

12:04.657 --> 12:10.587
You must be a worrywart if you're going 
to study abroad in the Alzer Republic.

12:10.887 --> 12:12.757
I don't have a choice.

12:12.757 --> 12:16.027
I'm curious to see how the changes 
to the first game affected it,

12:16.027 --> 12:19.277
and we could be looking at trouble 
if there's someone like Marie there.

12:19.277 --> 12:23.097
You would've been quite popular 
if you'd stayed in the kingdom.

12:23.097 --> 12:27.817
<i>Just how tough is this world for mobs?</i>

12:27.817 --> 12:28.577
Leon.

12:29.887 --> 12:31.037
Dad.

12:31.037 --> 12:32.607
Do you have a moment?

12:34.797 --> 12:36.147
An engagement party?

12:36.147 --> 12:39.717
Yeah. I'd like you to attend.

12:39.717 --> 12:42.807
I underestimated my brother.

12:42.807 --> 12:45.477
I didn't realize he'd made such 
good progress at finding a spouse.

12:45.477 --> 12:47.747
Yeah, I suppose.

12:48.347 --> 12:52.597
I can still leave in time to study 
abroad, so I'd be happy to attend.

12:55.327 --> 12:58.927
Wait a minute. Something's not right.

12:59.607 --> 13:01.427
Aren't you the man of the hour?

13:02.227 --> 13:04.427
Why is my outfit flashier?

13:05.757 --> 13:09.107
Well, you know... you're a count.

13:09.617 --> 13:14.187
What? Luxion, doesn't 
this seem strange to you?

13:14.187 --> 13:18.067
Does it? I'm sure everyone's just nervous.

13:18.787 --> 13:21.077
<i>No, something's definitely off.</i>

13:22.327 --> 13:23.947
<i>Wait. Could it be...</i>

13:36.177 --> 13:38.657
Did you trick me, old man?!

13:38.657 --> 13:41.037
I did no such thing.

13:41.037 --> 13:43.347
You simply misunderstood me.

13:44.267 --> 13:49.597
Since you're so indecisive, 
we made arrangements for you.

13:50.067 --> 13:52.107
H-How could you?

13:53.557 --> 13:56.107
<i>Th-The room is full of important guests!</i>

13:56.117 --> 13:57.577
<i>I can't run away!</i>

13:58.227 --> 14:01.237
Congratulations, milord.

14:01.237 --> 14:03.697
I have a letter from His Majesty for you.

14:03.697 --> 14:05.677
What? From the king?

14:08.747 --> 14:11.867
<i>I heard you've been running from marriage,</i>

14:11.867 --> 14:14.527
<i>so I've done everything in my 
power to move things along.</i>

14:15.647 --> 14:17.837
<i>Welcome to the end of your life.</i>

14:17.837 --> 14:21.297
<i>Sincerely, your talented 
and wonderful king.</i>

14:22.897 --> 14:25.387
Damn it!

14:32.247 --> 14:34.397
We're sorry for tricking you.

14:35.137 --> 14:38.277
But you kept dodging the question.

14:40.187 --> 14:42.657
Why'd you even fall for me?

14:43.237 --> 14:44.857
Because you're you.

14:45.297 --> 14:47.577
Leon, be my husband.

14:49.227 --> 14:52.537
I fell in love with you 
because you're you, Mr. Leon.

14:54.547 --> 14:56.437
I'll never let you go.

15:00.177 --> 15:02.177
Oh, fine. Do what you want.

15:07.017 --> 15:10.517
<i>It's not like I don't like them.</i>

15:11.147 --> 15:12.247
<i>I love them.</i>

15:16.047 --> 15:19.647
<i>I was tricked, but I don't 
feel terrible about it.</i>

15:21.847 --> 15:24.157
Congratulations on your engagement.

15:24.397 --> 15:27.367
That was a lovely ceremony.

15:27.807 --> 15:31.047
Is that all you have to say, 
you pieces of junk?

15:32.697 --> 15:34.957
<i>But tomorrow, I'm going to study abroad.</i>

15:34.957 --> 15:38.047
<i>I didn't think I'd be living by myself 
so soon after my engagement.</i>

15:47.507 --> 15:49.677
I'm not ready yet!

15:49.677 --> 15:50.387
Peek.

15:50.807 --> 15:55.377
What do you think we're here 
to do? We just came to talk.

15:52.177 --> 15:52.817
Peek.

15:55.377 --> 15:55.927
Huh?

15:56.357 --> 16:01.397
We haven't gotten a chance to 
talk much. Is that all right?

16:01.397 --> 16:02.897
Th-That's totally fine.

16:07.137 --> 16:08.887
We wanted to thank you.

16:09.377 --> 16:13.537
So much has happened since we met you.

16:13.937 --> 16:17.537
You've always stuck by our sides.

16:18.167 --> 16:20.147
You've helped us so much.

16:20.477 --> 16:22.667
Angie, Livia...

16:24.187 --> 16:25.677
I owe you guys.

16:26.477 --> 16:29.557
I don't know what I would've
done without you.

16:30.017 --> 16:33.677
Thank you. I owe Marie 
and those guys, too.

16:33.677 --> 16:35.057
You're right.

16:35.477 --> 16:37.807
Leon, you'd better come back.

16:38.557 --> 16:41.047
We'll be waiting for you.

16:42.307 --> 16:44.737
I promise I will.

16:45.947 --> 16:51.577
<i>After that, we stayed up late talking.</i>

16:53.457 --> 16:55.597
<i>It was torture.</i>

17:04.007 --> 17:07.667
Rauda, everyone's gone now.

17:08.607 --> 17:13.567
Father, Mother. Even Vandel is gone.

17:16.907 --> 17:21.567
If you leave me, I'll be all alone.

17:23.347 --> 17:27.107
<i>If only I'd been stronger.</i>

17:27.647 --> 17:32.117
<i>I'm reminded of the elf chief's words.</i>

17:33.277 --> 17:36.897
Leon Fou Bartfort...

17:38.327 --> 17:41.357
If you can find a way to walk together,

17:41.357 --> 17:44.377
your difficult path will 
be bathed in light,

17:44.377 --> 17:46.977
and they shall be a reliable 
source of support.

17:50.707 --> 17:52.887
You're leaving now?

17:53.387 --> 17:55.377
I feel sorry for you, Leon.

17:55.377 --> 17:58.367
You're finally getting more 
invitations from girls.

17:58.367 --> 18:02.017
Meanwhile, we're being treated like 
heroes for our evacuation efforts.

18:02.247 --> 18:05.277
We're in our popular phase!

18:05.277 --> 18:11.777
Popular phase! Popular phase! 
Popular phase!

18:05.277 --> 18:07.677
You'll pay for this.

18:07.677 --> 18:09.277
Leon.

18:09.637 --> 18:11.777
Ladies.

18:14.407 --> 18:19.287
If you get sick of the Redgraves, 
House Atlee is here for you.

18:19.777 --> 18:23.547
House Roseblade's doors 
are open to you, as well.

18:23.887 --> 18:26.017
Actually, what if...

18:26.017 --> 18:28.487
...we eloped right now?

18:29.377 --> 18:30.337
Mr. Leon.

18:31.157 --> 18:32.327
Master!

18:33.387 --> 18:35.977
Seeing the outside world 
will be a good experience.

18:35.977 --> 18:38.577
As both a gentleman and a person,

18:38.577 --> 18:42.107
may you deepen your code of 
chivalry as you push forward.

18:42.517 --> 18:43.567
Yes, Master.

18:43.827 --> 18:46.987
Master, it's nearly time to depart.

18:46.987 --> 18:49.867
I've procured a new ship 
for you so that you won't

18:49.867 --> 18:51.947
embarrass yourself as a 
representative of the kingdom.

18:56.467 --> 18:58.707
Whoa, it's awesome!

18:58.707 --> 19:03.077
It's the <i>Einhorn</i>. I thought it 
worthy of today's departure.

19:04.547 --> 19:06.587
Yeah. Let's go.

19:13.897 --> 19:17.717
You didn't need to see him off?

19:18.447 --> 19:22.917
No. It'd only cause trouble 
for him if we cried in public.

19:22.917 --> 19:25.447
How admirable.

19:25.447 --> 19:29.717
And there must be a reason he 
suddenly decided to study abroad.

19:29.717 --> 19:33.817
We plan to study really hard 
so we can help him someday.

19:34.767 --> 19:39.407
We need to grow so much that
he'll be surprised when he returns.

19:39.407 --> 19:40.317
You're right.

19:40.317 --> 19:41.507
Let's do our best.

19:44.677 --> 19:46.717
Damn it!

19:46.717 --> 19:51.877
That was a nice sendoff, 
but I don't want to go abroad!

19:51.877 --> 19:54.667
You just can't let it go, can you?

19:55.007 --> 19:58.917
Anyway, you're not going to open this box?

19:58.917 --> 20:01.407
It's apparently from the palace.

20:02.247 --> 20:04.397
Oh, right. They did give me something.

20:04.997 --> 20:08.017
Is it a gift for the Alzer Republic?

20:18.297 --> 20:20.507
Why did you close it?!

20:20.507 --> 20:22.997
What are you doing here?!

20:26.717 --> 20:28.247
W-Well, you see...

20:31.977 --> 20:33.757
Wh-What is this?

20:34.267 --> 20:36.757
We got this for you.

20:36.757 --> 20:39.277
We had it made by a reputable craftsman.

20:39.277 --> 20:41.527
It was pretty expensive.

20:41.527 --> 20:44.517
But we had our allowance from Bartfort.

20:44.517 --> 20:47.907
He kept trying to make your 
chest bigger. It was an ordeal.

20:49.617 --> 20:53.017
Th-They didn't hesitate 
to spend a fortune.

20:53.017 --> 20:56.207
A whole year of living 
expenses down the drain.

20:58.907 --> 21:02.907
<i>These worthless idiots!</i>

21:06.207 --> 21:09.417
<i>The queen was furious when she found out.</i>

21:12.437 --> 21:17.257
It seems you need to learn 
more about the world.

21:17.257 --> 21:20.427
Go study abroad with Leon!

21:23.707 --> 21:26.557
So the rest of them are here, too.

21:26.997 --> 21:29.217
Aren't you excited, Your Highness?

21:29.217 --> 21:29.937
Yeah.

21:30.307 --> 21:31.737
Alzer, huh?

21:31.737 --> 21:34.297
I'm happy anywhere, 
as long as I'm with Marie.

21:34.297 --> 21:36.697
I'll become a man worthy of her!

21:37.587 --> 21:39.657
We're starting anew.

21:39.657 --> 21:40.957
Yeah!

21:42.977 --> 21:47.707
So we'll be spending more 
time together, Brother.

21:48.317 --> 21:50.457
You can't be serious!

21:50.887 --> 21:54.957
Is this what they call beautiful 
brotherly and sisterly love?

21:55.717 --> 21:58.677
You two certainly are alike.

21:59.647 --> 22:00.967
Shut up!

22:01.187 --> 22:02.997
Damn it!

22:02.997 --> 22:05.597
This shitty otome game!

22:05.597 --> 22:11.377
This world is really tough for mobs!

22:12.857 --> 22:14.987
<b>Trapped in a Dating Sim 2</b>

23:36.497 --> 23:40.257
Supreme Commander

23:36.497 --> 23:40.257
Miura Kazuya
